{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02676","headline":"伤顾学士 · 孔绍安","name":"伤顾学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢遰双崤道，超忽三川湄。\n此中俱失路，思君不可思。\n游人行变橘，逝者遽焚芝。\n忆昔江湖上，同咏子衿诗。\n何言陵谷徙，翻惊邻笛悲。\n陈根非席卉，穗帐异书帷。\n与善成空说，歼良信在兹。\n今日严夫子，哀命不哀时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔绍安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}